# Converted with Script-Hub 6b4fb62 (service.js on 127.0.0.1, type=qx-rewrite&target=surge-module) on 2026-10-02.
# Edited after conversion:
#   - 12 script paths pinned to commits: Script-Hub-Org/Script-Hub@6b4fb62, fmz200/wool_scripts@5d5f63f
#   - Script-Hub turns the QX response-body rule into its replace-body.js script (1); kept as converted, renamed zhihu_replaceBody so names stay unique across modules
#   - the 10 scripts Script-Hub named zhihu are numbered zhihu_01..10 (Surge script names must be unique)
#   - no-resolve added to 2 IP rule(s): module rules sit at the top of the rule list, where an IP rule without it resolves every request locally
# Merged into surge/modules/rewrite.sgmodule by scripts/build_surge_modules.py. To refresh, reconvert
# the new source the same way, redo the edits above and send the result through a PR.
